WEBVTT

00:00.240 --> 00:05.100
A third-rank provincial governor, discarded at the drop of a hat... The Chen clan certainly plays for high stakes.

00:05.280 --> 00:10.200
No matter the cost to our house, the Chen family would never harbor a scoundrel who harms the state and its people.

00:10.480 --> 00:15.880
We hold indisputable confessions and testimonies in hand—ironclad proof that leaves no room for deceitful quibbling!
